+## Experimental native Windows host memory
+
+The runtime can import Vulkan external host memory on Windows. It queries the native page size, exposes the platform-neutral foreign acquirer and texture rotation helpers, and installs the Windows exit guard. DMA-BUF integration remains Unix-only. Native Windows host-memory tests and a shared-section GPU fill/readback were exercised; other platforms and the full runtime suite need regression validation.
